Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:13.35,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Cậu ấy biến mất rồi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:13.35,DefaultOverlap,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Amamiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.65,0:06:23.36,Signs,SIGN LEFT,0,0,0,,{\fs11\c&H9FB4C8&\3c&H3D3C50&\fax0.05\bord2\frz11.5\pos(230,103)}SỐ DƯ THẺ
